ver exactly what the request names, with no extra pages or marketing sections.\n- Use the supplied DATA in full: every field is there to be shown. Derive useful extras from it (shares, totals, deltas, rankings) instead of inventing unrelated numbers.\n- Where it fits, add status badges, trend/change figures, secondary actions, helper text, and sensible empty or edge-case copy.\n- Establish hierarchy with headings, size and weight; group related items; keep spacing and alignment consistent.\n- Make charts readable: a title, labelled axes or values, and a legend for pie charts.\n- Never use lorem ipsum or placeholder names like \"Item 1\".\n\nDATA (build the UI around this content):\n{\n  \"persona\": {\n    \"name\": \"Mira Kovač\",\n    \"role\": \"Product designer\",\n    \"city\": \"Ljubljana\",\n    \"bio\": \"I design calm, usable software for public services and small teams. Ten years across research, interaction design and front-end prototyping.\",\n    \"availability\": \"Open to freelance work from January\",\n    \"email\": \"mira@example.com\",\n    \"links\": [\n      \"Dribbble\",\n      \"LinkedIn\",\n      \"Read.cv\"\n    ],\n    \"stats\": [\n      {\n        \"label\": \"Years designing\",\n        \"value\": \"10\"\n      },\n      {\n        \"label\": \"Products shipped\",\n        \"value\": \"24\"\n      },\n      {\n        \"label\": \"People reached\",\n        \"value\": \"1.2M\"\n      }\n    ],\n    \"skills\": [\n      \"Interaction design\",\n      \"User research\",\n      \"Design systems\",\n      \"Prototyping\",\n      \"Service design\"\n    ]\n  },\n  \"projects\": [\n    {\n      \"title\": \"Transit app redesign\",\n      \"year\": 2026,\n      \"role\": \"Lead designer\",\n      \"client\": \"Ljubljana Public Transport\",\n      \"summary\": \"Cut trip-planning taps from 7 to 3 for 400k riders.\",\n      \"outcome\": \"App store rating rose from 3.4 to 4.6 in six months.\",\n      \"tags\": [\n        \"mobile\",\n        \"research\"\n      ]\n    },\n    {\n      \"title\": \"Clinic booking system\",\n      \"year\": 2025,\n      \"role\": \"Product designer\",\n      \"client\": \"Zdravje Clinics\",\n      \"summary\": \"Self-serve booking that halved front-desk calls.\",\n      \"outcome\": \"58% fewer booking calls; 91% of patients book online.\",\n      \"tags\": [\n        \"web\",\n        \"service design\"\n      ]\n    },\n    {\n      \"title\": \"Open data dashboard\",\n      \"year\": 2024,\n      \"role\": \"Design and front-end\",\n      \"client\": \"City of Ljubljana\",\n      \"summary\": \"City budget explorer used by 30k residents.\",\n      \"outcome\": \"Featured by two national newspapers; open-sourced.\",\n      \"tags\": [\n        \"data viz\"\n      ]\n    }\n  ],\n  \"testimonial\": {\n    \"quote\": \"Mira turned a tangle of requirements into something our riders actually enjoy using.\",\n    \"author\": \"Tina Zupan\",\n    \"role\": \"Head of Digital, LPP\"\n  }\n}","systemHash":"7f7b03405c279f095db892fdd24437dfc241ff3c8abb65e91da9e557823238ce","systemOverridden":false,"strictOutput":false,"rawOutput":"<!DOCTYPE html>\n<html lang=\"en\">\n<head>\n<meta charset=\"UTF-8\">\n<meta name=\"viewport\" content=\"width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0\">\n<title>Mira Kovač — Product Designer</title>\n<style>\n  :root {\n    --accent: #2f5d50;\n    --accent-soft: #e7f0ec;\n    --ink: #16211d;\n  }\n  body { font-family: \"Georgia\", \"Iowan Old Style\", serif; }\n  h1, h2, h3, .stat-value, .badge { font-family: -apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, \"Segoe UI\", Helvetica, Arial, sans-serif; }\n  .page { max-width: 900px; }\n  .hero { border-bottom: 1px solid var(--ink); padding-bottom: 2rem; }\n  .eyebrow { letter-spacing: .18em; text-transform: uppercase; font-size: .72rem; font-family: -apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, \"Segoe UI\", Helvetica, Arial, sans-serif; color: var(--accent); }\n  .name { font-size: 3.2rem; line-height: 1.05; margin: .2rem 0 .1rem; letter-s